        "content": "## ⚙️ Configuration Required\n\nSet these **n8n environment variables** before activating:\n\n| Variable | Description | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| `FASTIFY_API_BASE_URL` | Fastify API base URL | `http://localhost:3000` |\n| `FASTIFY_API_KEY` | API authentication key | `your-secret-key` |\n\n**Set via:** n8n → Settings → Environment Variables\n\n---\n\n### What changed from v1:\n- ❌ Google Calendar removed → ✅ `GET /api/calendar/slots`\n- ❌ Google Sheets (Appointments) removed → ✅ `POST /api/appointments`\n- ❌ Google Sheets (Patient Info) removed → ✅ `POST /api/patients`\n- ❌ Calculate Available Slots Code node removed → ✅ Handled server-side in Fastify\n- ✅ New `doctor_name` parameter supported in check_availability & book_appointment",
